    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103661" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τευτ-άζω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετεύτακα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					521e
				</span></i>
			:—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. περί τι</span>
			<i>to be employed upon, engaged in, concerned with</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				56e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ti.</u>
				90b
			</span></i>: abs., <i>to be busy, bustling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Telecl.
				36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				89
			</span></i> (anap.): c. inf., <i>bid</i> or
			<i>order</i> one <i>repeatedly</i> to do a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				184
			</span></i> (anap.):- also 
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.Com.
				36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				13.161c
			</span></i>.</div>
